Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Go module dependencies are declared in go.mod and fetched by the Go toolchain;
each carries its own license (all permissive: Apache-2.0, MIT, or BSD). This
repository does not vendor their source.

Generated Protobuf Go bindings under gen/ are produced by protoc-gen-go
(google.golang.org/protobuf, BSD-3-Clause) from the .proto sources under proto/.

The bundled reference service under reference-llm/ depends on third-party Python
packages declared in reference-llm/pyproject.toml, each under its own license.

